    "title": "Vertical Dramas in Thailand: App Revenue, Brand Mini Dramas & Thai Studios",
    "url": "https://megaevolution-en.tistory.com/entry/Vertical-Dramas-in-Thailand-App-Revenue-Brand-Mini-Dramas-Thai-Studios",
    "date": "2026-11-09",
